## Interface: 20400
## Title: JevRadio
## Notes: Paints client state as a pixel strip. Reads only, never actuates (PLAN 2.2).
## Author: Jev
## Version: 1.0.0
## DefaultState: enabled

# Load order is a dependency order, not a preference.
#   Helpers  defines the measurement functions the generated getters call.
#   Fields   is GENERATED from jev/perceive/fields.py and must never be hand-edited.
#   JevRadio hands each generated getter its environment, then packs and paints.
# Fields.lua before Helpers.lua would still load -- the getters resolve names at call
# time -- but JevRadio.lua genuinely cannot build the getter environment before Helpers
# has produced it.
Supplies.lua
Helpers.lua
Fields.lua
JevRadio.lua
